{"Rick pulled into his driveway, his old Explorer coated in a hazy film of white salt. The winter night had rolled in quickly, the town bathed in darkness by \003six p.m.\004 He asked Bill to grab his papers and a bit of weed.","Ohio","Stephen Markley",false},
