{"Ursula invites me into the wardrobe. “You haven’t aged a day, Timbo, and neither has \001this\002 snaky fellow!” Her furry fawn rubs up against my Narnian-sized lamppost and mothballs … but then, as ever, I awoke, my swollen appendage as welcome as a swollen appendix, and as useful. \003Six o’clock\004. The heating systems composed works in the style of John Cage. Chillblains burned my toe knuckles. I thought about Christmases gone, so many more gone than lay ahead.","Cloud Atlas","David Mitchell",false},
