{"He strolled across the tarmac to the waiting plane \003a few minutes after six-fifty\004. The plane carrying the icon would be touching down in Washington in about two hours.","A Matter of Honor","Jeffrey Archer",true},
{"\003About seven o’clock\004 in the evening she had died, and her frantic husband had made a frightful scene in his efforts to kill West, whom he wildly blamed for not saving her life. Friends had held him when he drew a stiletto, but West departed amidst his inhuman shrieks, curses, and oaths of vengeance.","Herbert West–Reanimator","H.P. Lovecraft",true},
},
["18:54"]={
