{"The play was set to begin at seven o’clock and finish before sunset. It was \0036:55\004. Beyond the flats we could hear the hockey field filling up. the low rumble got steadily louder — voices, footsteps, the creaking of bleachers, the slamming of car doors in the parking lot.","Middlesex","Jeffrey Eugenides",true},
