{"She didn’t emerge again until 6:32 p.m. She was dressed in her civilian clothes, and headed in the direction of Summers’s flat, stopping on the way to pick up one of his suits from the dry cleaner’s. At \0036:58\004 she let herself into the house.","Turn a Blind Eye","Jeffrey Archer",true},
{"Walk fast, says Perry, “it’s \003two minutes to seven\004, and I got to be home by—”\n“Oh, shut up,” says I. “I had an appointment as chief performer at an inquest at seven, and I’m not kicking about not keeping it.”","Roads of Destiny","O. Henry",true},
